{"id":"torrey:christ-the-head-of-the-church","source":"torrey","name":"Christ, The Head Of The Church","slug":"christ-the-head-of-the-church","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Predicted — Ps 118:22; Mt 21:42.","refs":[["Ps",118,22,118,22],["Matt",21,42,21,42]]},{"text":"Appointed by God — Eph 1:22.","refs":[["Eph",1,22,1,22]]},{"text":"Declared by himself — Mt 21:42.","refs":[["Matt",21,42,21,42]]},{"text":"As his mystical body — Eph 4:12,15; 5:23.","refs":[["Eph",4,12,4,12],["Eph",4,15,4,15],["Eph",5,23,5,23]]},{"text":"Has the pre-eminence in all things — 1Co 11:3; Eph 1:22; Col 1:18.","refs":[["1Cor",11,3,11,3],["Eph",1,22,1,22],["Col",1,18,1,18]]},{"text":"Commissioned his Apostles — Mt 10:1,7; 28:19; Joh 20:21.","refs":[["Matt",10,1,10,1],["Matt",10,7,10,7],["Matt",28,19,28,19],["John",20,21,20,21]]},{"text":"Instituted the ordinances — Mt 28:19; Lu 22:19,20.","refs":[["Matt",28,19,28,19],["Luke",22,19,22,19],["Luke",22,20,22,20]]},{"text":"Imparts gifts — Ps 68:18; Eph 4:8.","refs":[["Ps",68,18,68,18],["Eph",4,8,4,8]]},{"text":"Saints are complete in — Col 2:10.","refs":[["Col",2,10,2,10]]},{"text":"Perverters of the truth do not hold — Col 2:18,19.","refs":[["Col",2,18,2,18],["Col",2,19,2,19]]}],"refCount":22}
